<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24456" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">inter-scindo</span></b> , scĭdi, scissum,
		3, v. a., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to tear asunder</i>, <i>break down; to
				separate</i>, <i>interrupt</i> (class.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pontem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes. B.
					G. 2, 9</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Leg. 2, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aggerem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. G. 7, 24</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venas,</span>”
				i. e. <i>to open</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 15, 35</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>to break</i> or
				<i>cut off</i>, <i>to separate</i>,
				<i>part</i>, <i>divide</i>, <i>hinder</i>, <i>interrupt</i>, <i>disturb</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Chalcis arto interscinditur freto, Liv 28, 7:
					ruina interscindit aquas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Q. N. 3, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vinculum animi atque amoris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 12, 1, 21</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">laetitiam,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep. 72, 5</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
